              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "zuǐ is the everyday word for the mouth; 口 kǒu mostly appears inside other words, as in rùkǒu 'entrance'."
            }
